Package: libgcrypt
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libgpg-error (>= 1.61), libsystem
Description: GnuPG cryptographic library
 libgcrypt provides the ciphers, hash functions, public-key algorithms
 and random number generator that GnuPG uses.

Package: libgcrypt-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libgcrypt (= ${binary:Version}), libgpg-error-dev (>= 1.61)
Description: GnuPG cryptographic library: development files
 The header, the pkg-config file and the autoconf macro for building
 programs against libgcrypt.
